ess_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","review_id":"47-6VeJLOIzMUVZ3s4qhEg","date":"2018-09-07T18:32:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9555075168609619,"text_excerpt":"When my friends would talk about Blaze Pizza coming to NOLA when they were first opening, I had no idea what they were talking about. I was just used to the usual chain pizza places like Domino's or Papa Johns. Blaze Pizza advertised that their pizza would be cooked in 180 seconds and I've heard great things, so I had to give them a try! When I first walked in, I thought the place looked nice with eager employees ready to help me! I had to figure out how this place worked, since it was my first time at a Blaze Pizza. There was an overhead menu with signature pizzas and other choices, but there were paper menus to Build-Your-Own-Pizza at the beginning of the line. I almost chose the Meat E..."},{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","review_id":"ltPf5fk3swKQKuR8CKwV2w","date":"2019-10-16T15:09:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9486066699028015,"text_excerpt":"We really wanted pizza and I was trying to think of good pizza close by and I almost forgot about Blaze! I feel like it's funny because it's like a fast food place, but the pizza is so delicious and you get to customize it to whatever you want. It's so much cheaper than getting a dominos pizza with a ton of toppings, and Blaze has so many more toppings. I love that they put it in the oven right in front of you and then you can put a drizzle of olive oil, pesto, or even bbq sauce on top. And I love putting fresh arugula on top too. I got an original crust with spicy red sauce, which was amazing and the perfect amount of spice! Then I piled on a bunch of veggies - tomatoes, mushrooms, olive..."},{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","review_id":"ja2IDyibUivr0_oH3UhAGA","date":"2018-05-20T13:02:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9444447755813599,"text_excerpt":"Gosh!! I really love Blaze! I went for the first time for Yelp's BYOP event last year and knew it wouldn't be my last time. The staff is uber friendly, the ingredients are all fresh, and I love how the dough is shaped right in front of you! Blaze has a no frills policy. The pizza is set basically at a fixed cost. You don't have to pay extra for toppings. They also have vegan cheese for no extra cost, #winning. You're greeted upon entry every single time, and the employees and professional. I'm really happy that the pizza comes at an affordable price, and I can't get over the freshness of the ingredients!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","photo_id":"higF3-l9rHCWpKroBxD2_A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/higF3-l9rHCWpKroBxD2_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8576981425285339},{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","photo_id":"-gYNvnhTUiC3FdRzGa5B1w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-gYNvnhTUiC3FdRzGa5B1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7802157402038574},{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","photo_id":"9DPeZl9pAHi-LbM5ETDvQw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9DPeZl9pAHi-LbM5ETDvQw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7655913829803467},{"business_id":"qi2MFcotB3YgiC0SJr2FmQ","photo_id":"2x-853y2CGvyZy8qsaMEWA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2x-853y2CGvyZy8qsaMEWA.jpg","visu